{"topicSections":[{"title":"Checking from a test","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)"],"anchor":"Checking-from-a-test"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracking plan is how the people and services that read an app’s events learn what each event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holds, so it is only useful while it matches the events. With this test, a change to an event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t pass the app’s tests until the plan is exported again, and reviewers see the change as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"JSON diff of the plan. The test’s report also says which changes would break payloads from released","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app versions or records already stored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" checks a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" against the plan"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"committed in a directory, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan.check(againstDirectory:)"},{"type":"text","text":" does. When they differ, it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"records a Swift Testing issue whose comment is the check’s report, the same text the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"command prints, and it returns the check either way. A plan that is only out of date fails the test"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a breaking one does: in both cases the committed plan isn’t what exporting the events writes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the product to an app’s test target, so the check runs wherever the app’s tests do. It imports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Swift Testing, so it belongs in test targets only. To run the check from the command line or CI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without a test, use the app’s own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlanCommand"},{"type":"text","text":" executable from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlans"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Foundation","import Testing","import TrackingPlanTesting","","@Test func eventsMatchTheTrackingPlan() throws {","    let directory = URL(fileURLWithPath: #filePath)","        .deletingLastPathComponent()","        .appendingPathComponent(\"TrackingPlan\")","    expectTrackingPlan(try AppTrackingPlan.trackingPlan, matches: directory)","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers exporting the plan this test checks."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplantesting"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fail a Swift Testing test when an app’s events no longer match its committed tracking plan, so every change to an event comes with a change to the plan."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"collection","title":"TrackingPlanTesting","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlanTesting"}],"externalID":"TrackingPlanTesting","roleHeading":"Framework"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://TrackingPlanTesting/documentation/TrackingPlanTesting/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a Swift Testing issue when "},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" no longer matches the plan committed in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"directory","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", its comment the check’s report, as the "},{"code":"check","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" command prints it."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplantesting\/expecttrackingplan(_:matches:sourcelocation:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)","title":"expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"expectTrackingPlan","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"matches","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sourceLocation","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SourceLocation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Testing14SourceLocationV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanCheckO"}]},"doc://TrackingPlanTesting/documentation/TrackingPlanTesting":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Fail a Swift Testing test when an app’s events no longer match its committed tracking plan, so every change to an event comes with a change to the plan.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplantesting","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting","title":"TrackingPlanTesting"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/trackingplanworkflow":{"title":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","type":"link"}}}